{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kogane.live",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "live 结束以后",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kogane.live",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kogane.live",
    "idolId": "kogane",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "不过……要是我一个人的话，肯定来不到这里",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，偶像要有粉丝的期待和支持才行。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "嗯……不过，不只是这样",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "在老家夸我的歌和舞、说我能当偶像的食堂客人……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "我想对那些人说谢谢",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我也很感谢那些把这么棒的偶像送来的人。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿……然后，我要道谢的人里，还有从我来东京之后一直陪在身边的……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "制作人ばい",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "恋鐘……该道谢的是我。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "……制作人。我能走到这里也是托制作人的福，你也稍微骄傲一点嘛！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可是我只是做了理所当然的事，没什么特别的。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "真是的……你完全不了解自己呢！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "不过，就是那种地方……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "没、没什么！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……？那就好。……不过，不只是我，也想让老家的人看到恋鐘的舞台啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "嗯！让大家看到我的感谢……为了这个，长崎凯旋 live！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此，凯旋 live 啊……确实是个好主意。好，虽然不知道什么时候，但一定要办。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我也想看到恋鐘在长崎舞台上发光的样子。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "嗯！我和制作人的话，马上就能实现长崎 live ばい！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "我们两个人，没有实现不了的愿望！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "然后……如果那个实现了的话……",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "……会让你更喜欢长崎的",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "长崎的事……让你喜欢得和我一样！期待吧！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "恋鐘，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "啊，制作人！你看了吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，今天的 live 也很棒。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "谢谢……我一直憧憬着这个世界……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "现在，居然能站上这么大的舞台了呢",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。不过恋鐘还能站上更大的舞台。所以，继续往上走吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "……嗯……是啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "让我当偶像的话，没人比得过我！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
